<SubSection title="General Stress Tensor" id="tensor">
<p>
 The components of normal and shear stress can be combined into the stress tensor. This is a symmetric matrix representing the state of stress with respect to three directions.
</p>

<DisplayEquation equation=" T= \\begin{bmatrix} \\sigma_{x} & \\sigma_{xy} & \\sigma_{xz} \\\\ \\sigma_{yx}& \\sigma_{y} & \\sigma_{yz} \\\\ \\sigma_{zx}&\\sigma_{zy}&\\sigma_{z} \\end{bmatrix} \\" title="Stress tensor." background="True"/>
</SubSection>


